2d-truss-analysis (3.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Production release v3.0.0.
  * Clean layered C++20 architecture with strict separation of domain,
    infrastructure, application, interface, and presentation layers.
  * Qt6 MVC GUI with interface-driven controllers and presenters.
  * Direct stiffness method (displacement method) analysis engine with
    LDLT factorization via Eigen3.
  * 1603 passing tests; 88.3% line coverage, 91.9% function coverage.
  * FHS-compliant Linux packaging with CPack DEB for GUI, CLI, and
    common components.
  * AppStream metainfo for software centre discovery.
  * Multi-format export: CSV, JSON, XML, HTML, LaTeX, and plain text.
  * Dark and light QSS themes.

 -- Neil Taison Rigaud <ntsrigaud14@gmail.com>  Sun, 08 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
